CDCl3) δ 159.1, 156.7, 148.3, 130.4, 125.7, 121.7, 121.4, 119.9, 118.3,
115.1, 113.3, 55.6; IR (Film) ν 2836, 2232, 1578, 1505, 1480, 1321, 1241,
1204, 1104, 944 cm-1; HRMS (EI+) m/z calcd. for C14H11NO2 [M]+: 225.0791,
